CONTEXT Migration IN ENGLISH
-- A relation is shared by the two systems only if its name and its signature are the same (eqn:copy relations).
-- loan[Book*Person] of the existing system and loan[Book*Member] of the desired system are two relations,
-- so copying the one into the other is a type error.
INCLUDE "../scripts/library_migration.adl"

ENFORCE copyLoan : new.loan >: old.loan

ENDCONTEXT
